### PBAC 权限验证测试 - 对应 UserController

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### --------------------------------------------------
### @RequirePolicy 测试（固定权限码）
### --------------------------------------------------

### 1. 创建用户 - 有 USER:CREATE 权限
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:CREATE","USER:VIEW"]}

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 预期: 200（业务成功）或 500（数据库未连接）

### 2. 创建用户 - 无 USER:CREATE 权限
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 2
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:VIEW"]}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 预期: 403 AccessDeniedException

### 3. 更新邮箱 - 有 USER:UPDATE 权限
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001/email?email=new@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:UPDATE","USER:VIEW"]}

### 预期: 200（业务成功）或 404（用户不存在）

### 4. 更新邮箱 - 无 USER:UPDATE 权限
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001/email?email=new@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 2
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:VIEW"]}

### 预期: 403 AccessDeniedException

### 5. 停用用户 - 有 USER:DELETE 权限
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:DELETE","USER:VIEW"]}

### 预期: 200（业务成功）或 404（用户不存在）

### 6. 停用用户 - 无 USER:DELETE 权限
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 2
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:VIEW"]}

### 预期: 403 AccessDeniedException

### --------------------------------------------------
### @RequirePermission 测试（RBAC 风格: resource + action）
### --------------------------------------------------

### 7. 获取用户 - 有 USER:READ 权限
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:READ","USER:VIEW"]}

### 预期: 200（业务成功）或 404（用户不存在）

### 8. 获取用户 - 无 USER:READ 权限
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 2
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["ORDER:READ"]}

### 预期: 403 AccessDeniedException

### --------------------------------------------------
### 边界场景测试
### --------------------------------------------------

### 9. 缺少权限 Headers - 无认证信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json

### 预期: 500（Missing required header: x-user-id）

### 10. 空权限列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1
x-tenant-permissions: {}

### 预期: 403（无任何权限）

### 11. 当前租户不在可访问列表中
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 2,3
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:READ"],"2":["USER:READ"]}

### 预期: 403（租户1不在可访问列表[2,3]中）

### 12. 多租户 - 跨租户有权限
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-001
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-tenant-id: 1
x-accessible-tenants: 1,2
x-tenant-permissions: {"1":["USER:READ","USER:VIEW"],"2":["USER:READ"]}

### 预期: 200（当前租户1有 USER:READ）
